WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.550
I can't do this anymore. I'm going to give these CDs back to my sister!

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:53.110
This is the first time you've ever disobeyed your sister, is it not?

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.740
Are you okay with that?

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:55.960
It's fine!

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:57.740
Ah, Chairman!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.070
Sanjo-kun!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:01.830
Where did you-

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.940
Teaser CDs?

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.430
Why do you have so many?

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:13.430
What a surprise. You still believe that?

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.910
You people are such good-natured fools.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.130
The one who's been distributing the CDs is indeed me.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.920
I'm a spy for Easter.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.620
Your enemy.

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:31.100
Episode 41
Your True Self!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:43.760
Tell me what you long for most.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.650
What is it you desire?

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:54.370
Try shouting it out with a voice

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.650
Excellent, just as I've come to expect from Utau.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.240
Since Dia joined us, her power to take eggs has increased,

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:00.730
loud enough to overpower the volume.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.400
but it also seems her singing voice is shining brighter as well.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.400
While the sun-

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:09.930
On the other hand, you weren't able to distribute the teaser CDs, and even blew your cover to them.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.880
It doesn't matter anymore. Everything we've done so far has only been a rehearsal.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.600
An X Egg?

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:21.400
Oh, you didn't know? This is how you make the teaser CDs.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.110
A CD press?

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:26.400
We'll begin now.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.170
Watch carefully, okay?

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:45.280
See, it's simple. One teaser CD, ready to go.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.610
Simple, right?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.050
Yuu hit upon the idea of using the energy of the X Eggs.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:58.220
Yuu, I mean, Nikaidou, had the power to extract eggs from children's weak hearts.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:02.070
Utau can do the same with her singing.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.970
However, it only works on kids who attend her concerts.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.350
But this teaser CD is different.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:15.570
By pressing the X Eggs into them, they power up, which allows us to extract eggs just by using a recording.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:23.540
Using the teaser CD, we collect a large number of X Eggs, and then take those and turn them into more teaser CDs.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.920
It's a pretty amazing recycling method, wouldn't you agree?

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.040
It's frightening.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:33.710
What are you talking about? You're the one who's so good at that efficiency and probability stuff.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:39.320
Sheesh, don't tell me you were converted by those goody two-shoes Guardians.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.310
That's...

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:45.160
Listen, Kairi, you are a spy. A traitor.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:49.590
Don't think of those Guardians as your friends anymore.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.020
Right.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.440
I can't believe that Kairi...

00:04:56.490 --> 00:05:00.020
I cannot believe he would become an enemy of the Guardians!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.580
I can't believe it!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:04.520
Coming from El, that doesn't give me much confidence.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.250
I'm sure there's some reason for this.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.410
Right, Chairman?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.960
Okay! Good work, Utau-chan!

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.460
Utau! Character Change with me the next time you sing, okay?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.330
It's always been Dia lately.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.160
Ikuto!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:35.380
Hey.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.360
You came!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.570
Ikuto!

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.840
Ikuto! Ikuto! Ikuto!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.210
Ikuto!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.300
You big meany.

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:49.930
Your hugging attempts are easy to predict.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.240
It's no use-nya! Give up-nya!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.730
So are you finished with your session already?

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.650
Yeah, since your vocals are recorded separately.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:07.290
I'm so happy that I get to sing with your violin.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.610
Only because Easter ordered me to.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:16.520
Damn that old man. He forbids so much music, but he makes an exception for this.

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.380
What?

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.650
Can I have a kiss?

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.470
No.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.160
But we finally get to see each other!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.100
No.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.240
Just one on the cheek?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.270
No.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.890
Why is it always Dia?!

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:37.630
I'm bored, bored, bored, bored!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:46.360
Kicking over X Eggs isn't any fun.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.430
They don't cry like a little baby like El does.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.700
El.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.280
You're made for each other-nya.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.850
Kairi.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:10.800
There are times in a warrior's life when his opinion on the path set before him is unnecessary.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:15.320
And that is why I have, thus far, bit my tongue about what my master has been doing.

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:19.340
However, that master has now become merely a pile of regrets.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.330
I don't really regret...

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.340
Oh, Sanjo-kun?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.440
What are you doing out this late?

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.300
Oh, I see. This is Easter's recording studio.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.870
Helping out your sister?

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.410
I am not obligated to answer.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.940
You are no longer part of Easter, nor are you my sister's boyfriend.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:41.460
Man, I sure get a bad rap.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.050
So they found out about it? Your true identity, that is.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.150
Guess I'm right.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.560
Thank you for keeping silent about it all this time.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.930
But that all ends today.

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:58.010
I didn't keep quiet for your sake, you know.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.610
I was just curious.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:06.430
I wondered how being under the influence of the Guardians would change the boy who always acts cool as an adult.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.380
Especially Hinamori Amu.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:13.650
That girl has a mysterious power to captivate those around her.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:17.450
She might be able to drag the real you out.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.140
That's what I thought, you see.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.130
The real me?

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:23.700
Yup. The guy you want to be.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.190
Anyway, that's enough from me for today.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.230
I'm out doing a shopping run for the Shop Club.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.630
Oh, if you ever get the urge, feel free to come over anytime!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.280
But I'm no longer a student at Seiyo Elementary.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.270
Look at this picture!

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.090
A job with artists, announcers, music, television appearances is just so great! But being a star's manager is a very important job. We'll talk to this person today about how she handles it!

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.090
Careers Girls Aspire to Today

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.090
Artist Manager Sanjo Yukari-san (Easter Music)

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:46.010
It's a shot of Hoshina Utau's manager!

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.940
Hey, she...

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.830
She looks just like Sanjo-kun.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.580
There's no mistake, then.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.720
The Jack is Easter's spy.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.740
He had to be the one who was spreading the CDs around school.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.840
This sucks!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.070
I am so pissed by this!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.620
He takes over a vacant seat in the Guardians...

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.650
Even though he's younger than me, he acts like he's the boss!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.670
He's all super serious about doing Guardian stuff!

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.870
He's always trying as hard as he can.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.240
And he's always so serious.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.750
He's always...

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.270
I want to see the Chairman again, no matter what.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.200
I just can't picture that as who he really is.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:29.210
Yeah.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.190
That's right.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.590
If you're talking about Sanjo-kun, he's absent today.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:43.680
At this rate, he might never come back to this school.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.090
Sensei! Are you eating well?

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.430
Please stop sounding like my mother.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.240
Why have you come here?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.090
Here, I thought I'd give them to you.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.650
Black Diamond's Secret Concert?

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.710
It's today!

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:06.340
I got them from Sanjo-kun, but I have to help with the Shop Club.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.790
Did you really get them from him?

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.460
Maybe we can see the Chairman!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.510
Let's go!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.630
Yeah.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.290
Sensei.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.300
Thank you!

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.690
The real me...

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.410
Kairi, we must go soon.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.540
Your sister called you, did she not?

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.320
Yeah.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:02.390
This isn't good. It's already past when it's supposed to start!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.580
Jeez, where the heck <i>is</i> this concert?

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.910
Are you okay, Mashiro-san?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.510
I'm totally fine.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.120
I can hear it! I can hear Utau-chan's song!

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.450
Really, El?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.870
Isn't this just one of your usual mistakes?

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.170
This is not a mistake!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:30.240
If you lose your way, you'll lose your worth.

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:38.970
Free yourself of everything under this warped night sky.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:45.080
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.010
Man, she Character Changed with Dia again.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:54.670
It's finally their major debut!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:58.500
Wow! They have a new member, don't they?

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.010
That guy's pretty cool, you know?

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.970
It's rock, but the violin still works!

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:15.400
So what do you desire? What do you seek?

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:18.040
The brilliance collected in the palm of that hand

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:26.320
will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:30.080
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.740
Wait!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:37.080
I will not allow you to take people's eggs anymore!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:40.620
The Angel of Love, Amulet Angel,

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.340
takes the stage!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.080
Amu-chi.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.970
I can't watch.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.220
Hey, El, you're going overboard!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.490
The heroine <i>should</i> go overboard.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:52.760
Joker... Everyone...

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.970
So they appear again; those meddlesome pests.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.470
Amu.

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:02.160
You're one step too late, Amu.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:04.930
Dia.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.060
My heart:

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.240
Unlock!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.840
Character Transformation: Dark Jewel.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:26.030
So Black Diamond really is Utau.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.600
Utau-chan.

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:31.710
You're always getting in my way.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.290
Why do you have to steal eggs?

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:36.680
Is this who you really want to be?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.470
What do you know?

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:43.460
Is the way you are now really the person you want to be?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:47.380
What?

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.810
Let's go, Utau.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.160
Hey, wait!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.300
Hinamori-san!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:56.430
Chairman!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.420
Sanjo-kun!

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:06.230
I will be your opponent from here on, Joker.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:07.670
Chairman.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.110
I'm counting on you, Kairi!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.430
Wait!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.130
Chairman!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.020
Forgive me, but I must cut you down!

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:26.260
I was subbed out.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:32.720
It's a lie, right? You being our enemy?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.880
Ever on the battlefield.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.650
Hinamori-san!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.680
The X Eggs!

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:07.890
Amu-chan!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:10.790
We're going, too.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.990
Right!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.540
What's that? It's gross!

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:31.770
Let's fight, too!

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:32.420
Yeah.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.760
My heart:

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.080
Unlock!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.860
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:04.010
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.450
Juggling Party!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.450
We did it!

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.660
Holy Crown!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:35.980
Tadase-kun!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:38.440
Even I can't just stand here doing nothing!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.550
Yeah!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.370
Gigantic Rattle Attack!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.330
Wait, Yaya, I said it's dangerous!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.480
Yaya-tan!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.470
Pepe-chan!

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.770
Could this be?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:16:59.690
Yeah!

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:01.770
My heart:

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.150
Unlock!

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:04.760
Yeah!

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.060
Come on, Pepe-chan!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.700
Right-dechu!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.540
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:26.580
Oh man, this is super cute!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.010
I'll take a picture to send to Mama!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:29.990
Hey!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:36.530
Go, special attack...

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.190
Merry Merry!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.920
It's actually pretty effective!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.220
She even put herself to sleep.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:52.450
I'll be your opponent, Joker!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.280
Chairman!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.740
W-Wait!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.590
M-My...

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:02.480
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.620
Sweet Applique!

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.650
That is such a cute arrangement.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.490
This is a serious battle!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.940
I'd ask that you not make light of it!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.920
I still believe in you.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.030
I don't care if that's simpleminded or stupid.

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.330
I want to believe!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.840
You're still spouting this nonse-

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.930
Kairi...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.890
Because the Kairi that we knew is the real you!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:36.500
Miyamoto Musashi

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:32.180
The real me?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:38.060
That's so awesome. Miyamoto Musashi would never lose to anyone.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.820
I want to be a samurai, too.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.770
But I don't just want to be strong, you know.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:48.040
If I come across people picking on the weak, I want to be able to save them!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.230
I want to become a kind samurai!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.180
Indeed.

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:54.550
To spend every day ascertaining what is right and what is wrong...

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.110
As Musashi said, the way of the warrior is to seek the true path.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.750
The true path.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.380
Everyone.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.130
Amu-chan!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:24.800
Hinamori-san!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.010
Amu!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.690
Run!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.100
The real me!

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:33.800
My heart:

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.360
Unlock!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.960
Character Transformation: Samurai Soul!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.350
Joker, together!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.320
Secret Technique: Thunder Blade!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:18.210
Remake Honey Special!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:28.500
That's it!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.610
There's that egg again.

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.660
Could that be the Embryo?

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.030
I apologize, everyone.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.120
I...

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.820
Enough already.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.160
Yeah, we've already forgiven you.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.440
But...

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:02.230
Chairman, everyone believed in you.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:16.030
Though you dost deem thyself righteous, a gaze untainted mayhap reveal you err, removed from the path of truth.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.050
What is that?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.270
Some kind of spell?

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:20.730
The words of Miyamoto Musashi.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:25.060
Even if you believe you are correct, it's possible you are mistaken.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:29.270
Therefore, you must always ascertain what is right.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:33.980
My true path is you, Joker.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.560
What, what? What's with this mood?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.510
Hey, you two!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.030
Ahem.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.620
Sorry to interrupt you there, but...

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:49.700
What? Black Diamond's going to debut for real?

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:52.090
The recording is already finished.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:56.420
The debut single is many times more powerful than that teaser CD.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:03.170
Tomorrow night, the master CD and a large number of X Eggs will be placed onboard a transport helicopter.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.670
Once that happens, there's no way we can stop them.

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:07.650
We won't allow it to, then!

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:09.870
We've got to stop them before the helicopter takes off!

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:14.970
Yeah. Tomorrow night, we'll finish this once and for all.

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:42.830
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:43.970
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:47.180
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:50.130
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:54.970
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:58.590
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.590 --> 00:23:02.130
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:05.140
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:05.890
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.510
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.300
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:13.220
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:16.660
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:17.600
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:18.640
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:20.880
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:27.510
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:34.670
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:54.470
Amu-chan, tomorrow's your final battle with Utau-chan, right?

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:55.770
We'll stop her.

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:57.540
And get Dia back!

00:23:57.570 --> 00:24:02.130
Yeah. But I don't really want to fight with Utau.

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:05.510
I'll show you I can stop her in my own way!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:06.800
Yeah, that's right.

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:08.690
All right, let's do it!

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:10.020
We will do our best!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:11.890
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:14.320
Hoshina Utau! The Final Battle!

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:18.110
Can you hear me, Utau? Please stop doing bad things.

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.620
Please, Utau!
